":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"145"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"40"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the member of the vocal department. She has a childish personality that is quick to act on her emotions. However, she is the genuine article, and a hard-worker who always tries to make up for her lack of talent. She is well-liked by her classmates and treated like a surrogate sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She strongly admires Midori, who was the representative of her class, and has a great deal of affection for her. She follows Midori around without regards to others. This led to some rumors about her being in love with Midori, but she takes it in stride."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24176"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"竜胆女子学院音楽学部の声楽学科に所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は感情をすぐ行動や口に出す、子供らしい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"けれど、ワガママという訳ではなく、裏表のないタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、努力家で、自分の実力の乏しさを自覚し、それを頑張って克服しようとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その姿勢に、周りの学生達から好感を得ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛い妹のような扱いを受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学科・専攻は違うが、２学年で代表となった碧に強い憧憬を抱き、まさに崇拝とも言えるような敬意と親愛を寄せている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その感情表現はストレートで、周りの事などお構いなしで碧に付きまとっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは、端から見れば激しい恋愛感情のように映り、一部で噂にまでなっているが、本人は一切気にせず、自分の思うまま行動している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24351","sourceWorkId":"8253","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"１学年　Ａクラス"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"音楽学部　声楽学科"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"竜胆女子学院音楽学部の声楽学科に所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は感情をすぐ行動や口に出す、子供っぽい性格。けれど、ワガママという訳ではなく、裏表のないタイプ。 また、努力家で、自分の実力の乏しさを自覚し、それを頑張って克服しようとしている。周りの学生達から好感を得ており、可愛い妹のような扱いを受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学科・専攻は違うが、2学年で代表となった碧に強い憧憬を抱き、まさに崇拝とも言えるような敬意と親愛を寄せている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情表現はストレートで、周りの事などお構いなしで碧に付きまとっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"端から見れば激しい恋愛感情のように映り、一部で噂にまでなっているが、本人は一切気にせず、自分の思うまま行動している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92797"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"75 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24351","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"a","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24351","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"145 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24351","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"79 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24351","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24351","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"40 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24351","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5bd7a3c2742e001ed14aa704508a2a9ef6ed2a520ca604499c83412c933f68be.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff0849f93d5e6a36668e40c3183dbbaf04c44fc84a6dfc6e1000e9122700d8a0.webp","width":89,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梶田夕貴","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:269668:92797:6106:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c24177","characterName":"榊原 薫子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92798","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"269668"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24352"],"vndbCharacterId":"c24177"},"originalCharacterName":"榊原 薫子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"903"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"97"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"98"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"61"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A teacher at the academy, and the deputy of the entire music department. There is another head, but she is the true leader of the academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a serious and domineering person. That's why she's strict about discipline and teaches student how to behave as according to traditions. Despite this, she still respects those who ask questions and concerns."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A 'Jack-of-all-trades' to her colleague due to her many abilities."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist is her enemy, and is always keeping an eye on him for any misconduct, which eventually lead to a probation period."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24177"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"竜胆女子学院の女教師。「音楽学」を担当し、音楽学部全体の副統括者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の上に、実際の統括もいるが、実質音楽学部を仕切っているのは彼女である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は真面目で堅物。故に規律に厳しく、伝統ある学院生としての振る舞い方を指導している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"けれど、その反面、相談や悩みなどにも真摯に受け答え、学生達から頼られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"このように、生徒指導や生活指導など、多方面に渡って顔を突っ込んでいるので、他の教員達からは『やり手』とか『キャリア』とか『お局様』などと陰で言われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明からさまに様相に難がある主人公を敵視（蔑視に近い）している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が竜胆女子学院で勤務するのは好ましくないと思う中、瀬川からの働きかけによって主人公を試用期間で切る事に成功する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、主人公が何かよからぬ事（不祥事）を起こすだろうと、常に目を光らせて監視している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瀬川と交際をしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24352","sourceWorkId":"8253","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"竜胆女子学院の女教師。「音楽学」を担当し、音楽学部全体の副統括者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の上に、実際の統括もいるが、実質音楽学部を仕切っているのは彼女である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は真面目で堅物。故に規律に厳しく、伝統ある学院生としての振る舞い方を指導している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"けれど、その反面、相談や悩みなどにも真摯に受け答え、学生達から頼られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒指導や生活指導など、多方面に渡り顔を突っ込んでいるので、他の教員達から『やり手』とか『キャリア』とか『お局様』などと陰で言われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明からさまに様相に難がある主人公を敵視（蔑視に近い）している。主人公が勤務するのは好ましくないと思う中、主人公を試用期間で切る事に成功する。また、主人公が何かよからぬ事（不祥事）を起こすだろうと、常に目を光らせて監視している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瀬川と交際をしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92798"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"97 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24352","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24352","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"166 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24352","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"98 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24352","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"61 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24352","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"45 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24352","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f18d75bc68f4a8403baefaef70fe6a93f90ace9700559d4bd1f1a8f753f1b7a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e008294758ea34bd99253a57f075f633134464f6b6191f812bb6984817f06247.webp","width":89,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"福元コヒロ","creatorId":"vndb:s806","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s806","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s806","name":"福元 コヒロ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:269668:92798:25160:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c6073","characterName":"東海林 碧","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92794","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"269668"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24348"],"vndbCharacterId":"c6073"},"originalCharacterName":"東海林 碧","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"408"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"40"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A member of the string department. Commonly known as the 'Lily Princess'. She has a clam and relaxed demeanor, but is also very gentle."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is strong-willed, with both conviction and yet the fragility of a girl on the verge of breaking."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She treats everybody kindly, including the protagonist, and is seen as a 'Holy Mother'."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A casual gesture pushes the protagonist's desire and caused him to assault her, but she tries to help him, trying to help him pay for his sins."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6073"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"竜胆女子学院の音楽学部、器楽学科で弦楽器専攻、ヴァイオリンを学んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"２学年にして、弦楽器専攻の代表に選ばれた、通称『百合の姫様』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆったり落ち着いた物腰で、包容力豊かな優しい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"芯はしっかりしており、信念を曲げない強さと、壊れてしまいそうな女の子らしい脆さを合わせ持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰に対しても隔てなく大らかに接し、その達観したような、どことなく感じさせる神秘性は、聖母のような印象を与える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に対しても偏見を持たず、他の者と同様に接してくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何気ない仕草から、主人公の欲望のスイッチを押してしまい、淫辱されてしまうが、それでも主人公を改心させて罪を償わせようと、諭すような様子で接し続ける。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24348","sourceWorkId":"8253","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"２学年　Ｂクラス"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"音楽学部　器楽学科　弦楽器専攻"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"専攻楽器はヴァイオリン"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"竜胆女子学院の音楽学部、器楽学科で弦楽器専攻、ヴァイオリンを学んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"2学年にして、弦楽器専攻の代表に選ばれた、通称『百合の姫様』。ゆったり落ち着いた物腰で、包容力豊かな優しい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"芯はしっかりしており、信念を曲げない強さと、壊れてしまいそうな女の子らしい脆さを合わせ持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰に対しても隔てなく接し、その達観したようなどことなく感じさせる神秘性は、聖母のような印象を与える。主人公にも偏見を持たずに接する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何気ない仕草から、主人公の欲望のスイッチを押してしまい、凌辱されてしまうが、それでも主人公を改心させて罪を償わせようと、諭すような様子で接し続ける。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92794"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24348","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"c","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24348","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24348","sourceWorkId":"8253","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sou